        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m not saying that every Ennead should be converted this way (that&#39;d be alot of villain decks for one theme), but the 9 god team seems like it&#39;d be a natural fit to take 5 or so of them and make versions for the new format introduced with Vengeance. They&#39;re already allied and can draw on multiple aspects of Egyptian mythology for their powers and abilities, and the Shrine of the Ennead could be made as an environment in and of itself.&nbsp;</p>",
